---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="LinAI is an AI intelligence publication. Research-grade sourcing, no hype.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">

    <h1 style="color:#F8FAFC;font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 1.5rem 0;">
      About Lin<span style="color:#06B6D4;">AI</span>
    </h1>

    <p style="color:#CBD5E1;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1.25rem 0;">
      LinAI is an AI intelligence publication built on one principle: every claim earns its place with a source.
      We cover the full AI landscape — research breakthroughs, regulatory developments, market movements,
      new tools, and societal implications — through a structured analytical lens.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#CBD5E1;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 1.25rem 0;">
      Every post is produced through a five-layer source system: technical researchers, independent analysts,
      institutional press, video transcripts, and investor intelligence. Articles are scored on a 7-point
      quality scale before any content is drafted. The author reviews the top-scoring sources and selects
      what to build each piece on.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#CBD5E1;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 2.5rem 0;">
      LinAI is the content arm of the LinAI Systems parent brand.
      <em style="color:#64748B;">"Linear solutions for complex intelligence."</em>
    </p>

    <div style="background-color:#1E293B;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <p style="color:#06B6D4;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 0.75rem 0;">What we cover</p>
      <ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.4rem;">
        {['Research Breakdown — new models, papers, and technical developments',
          'Tool Analysis — new AI products reviewed and situated in the landscape',
          'Policy Watch — regulation, governance, and AI law',
          'Market Intelligence — investment, funding, and economic data',
          'Opinion — data-backed takes on AI trends and debates',
          'Deep Dives — long-form systemic analysis',
          'Weekly Roundup — five key developments, every Sunday'].map((item) => (
          <li style="color:#CBD5E1;font-size:0.875rem;display:flex;gap:0.5rem;">
            <span style="color:#06B6D4;flex-shrink:0;">→</span>
            {item}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.75rem;">
      <a href="https://linai.beehiiv.com/subscribe" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         style="background-color:#06B6D4;color:#0F172A;font-weight:700;font-size:0.875rem;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">
        Subscribe to the newsletter →
      </a>
      <a href="https://x.com/LinAI_io" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         style="background-color:transparent;border:1px solid #334155;color:#CBD5E1;font-size:0.875rem;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">
        Follow on X
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
